    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "Board C of the Singles Event Companion is for Take and Hold against Disruption. The Take and Hold player plays Determined Acquisition and the Disruption player plays Death Trap. The app pairs this board with the Hammer and Anvil deployment. Neither disposition fixes the Attacker or Defender role; a roll-off settles that. Every zone, territory, objective and terrain position comes only from the official board image, and this entry states no measurements. Its lettered terrain pieces refer to the parts of the Battlefields: Armageddon kit.",
